#### 18. Backend Cryptographic Verification (HMAC-SHA256)
- **Method & Route**: `POST /payment/verify`
- **Request Payload** *(Returned by Razorpay checkout modal)*:
```json
{
  "razorpay_order_id": "order_NXd48Fhd7sYg",
  "razorpay_payment_id": "pay_NXd5PqRsTuVw",
  "razorpay_signature": "9b12a819b183cfa612d...",
  "orderId": "#ORD-1002"
}
```
- **Response `200 OK`**:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Payment verified successfully. Order confirmed!",
  "data": {
    "orderId": "#ORD-1002",
    "paymentStatus": "Paid",
    "status": "Processing",
    "totalAmount": 4199,
    "transactionId": "pay_NXd5PqRsTuVw",
    "paidAt": "2026-10-27T14:52:10.000Z"
  }
}
```

